title The fifteenth rung stays home, and the meter calls its fifth head to the digit
prompt Take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, Standfast on reds first, one council-rota row deep-read, send the increment
think Standfast opened the lap: crux/REDS.md read to its tail with REDS %130, %131, and %132 each closed, then tools/glow_tend_era_suite.rish run on metal rather than trusted -- GREEN at ten rungs. No red stood, so constructive work was free to begin.
think The running thread came from the top three rows of session-logs/README.md and the newest recommend line: the Caravan ladder lift arc, with weigh_the_answer named as the head at fourteen identical bodies over fifteen declarations by fifty-one lines, 624 by realized fall, zero widening.
think Confirmed the head by measurement rather than by inheritance -- sh tools/fixtures/ladder_reach_visibility_scan.sh weigh_the_answer printed REACH_OK family=weigh_the_answer folding=14 widens=0 stub=3 fall=624 before a line moved.
think Read the cohort at the head of the lap, as the last three laps each did. Hashing the fifteen bodies split them fourteen to one: suffice.rye writes report_out.weighed where the fourteen write suffice_of(report_out).weighed. Seven lines differ and nothing else does.
think Lifted the body into caravan/ladder_checks.rye as pub fn weigh_the_answer(comptime rung: type, io: std.Io, suffice: rung.Suffice, report_out: *rung.Report) (rung.RunError || rung.NoteError)!void, prefixing fourteen helper symbols with rung. so each reaches its own module through the type handed in. Error tags stay unprefixed, inferred from the error union exactly as the redress lift left them.
think Rewrote the fourteen rungs to three-line stubs with an awk pass, excluding caravan/ladder_checks.rye by name -- REDS %132's lesson applied rather than remembered, since the harness lives in the same directory the glob reads. The loop reported fourteen, matching what REACH_OK had named.
think Lowered the carry ceiling from 72522 to 71898 in tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh, repointed the two measured asserts in the carry witness, and rewrote its fold-queue and GREEN prose to this lap's numbers spelled as words, since caravan_ladder_prose_count_scan.sh refuses a bare digit run no assert holds.
think Advanced tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish by one slot: the folded family became weigh_the_answer, the head became confirm_pruned, and the sibling became seat_note -- each read off the scan rather than predicted.
obs Prediction met measurement to the digit for the fifth lap running. Carry 72,516 -> 71,892, a fall of exactly 624; delegates 3,015 -> 3,029, exactly the fourteen stubs; bodies 18,168 -> 18,169; distinct 7,965 -> 7,966; ceiling down to 71,898.
obs The derivation holds again: thirteen bodies times forty-eight net lines. One body survives in the harness and each stub costs three, so a family folding n at k lines returns (n-1)(k-3) -- fourteen minus one, times fifty-one minus three, is 624.
obs Run against the folded family afterward the same scan reads widens=14 fall=0, so the queue reports a door already through rather than offering it twice.
obs The split-on-one-qualifier shape has now appeared four laps running and seven times across the arc: deem, owe, avow, meet, apprise, redress, and now suffice. Every one turned out to be meaning rather than accident. A cohort is read at the head of the lap and its outlier is read for what it says.
obs The next head, confirm_pruned, is the first in this arc where all forty-four declaring rungs write the same body. There is no outlier to read, so the lap folds the whole family -- a different shape from the last four, and worth naming before it is met.
obs REDS %132's guard held on its first live lap without firing: the exclusion is written into the loop, and era rung ten sang GREEN over the folded tree.
obs Council rota, row three -- Water and Venus, care and flow. Gall's Law priced this arc exactly: nobody designed a harness carrying dozens of lifted bodies, and the harness is what one working lift turned into. The happy zone named why the lift is safe -- the body sits in the pure center where a witness runs instantly, and the thin edge stays where the world is. And growing a language named the move itself: diverge by strengthening rather than rewriting, since a lift changes what the code says and never what it does.
obs No red booked this lap.
