recommend keep-going confirm_pruned at forty-four identical bodies over forty-four declarations by fifteen lines -- 516 by realized fall, zero widening, and the first head in this arc with no outlier to read, so the whole family folds. Behind it seat_note and read_words at 504 apiece opening three declarations, read_count 462 opening three, revoke_one 468 opening forty over a nine-line stub. elder_waits returns the same 504 while opening all forty-three, so it is the cheapest-looking row that costs the most.
